      "Frames questions about directories, modules, tests, middleware, authentication, and data flow.",
      "Supports comparisons between implementations in different repositories.",
      "Requests Mermaid diagrams for architecture and data-flow visualization.",
      "Guides research into contribution workflows and testing patterns.",
      "Provides setup and verification instructions for the DeepWiki MCP server."
